        "support": "moderate",
        "text": "Machine learning improves the candidate-selection step of compiler optimization in Ansor by predicting the fitness or throughput of complete tensor programs during evolutionary search, so the search can score many candidates before choosing programs for expensive hardware measurement."
      },
      {
        "claim_ids": [
          "claim-ansor-s-learned-cost-model-predicts-tensor-program-throughput-accurately-enough--f02bf9f271c3"
        ],
